## 2. Candidate Interview Database

### 2.1 Bảng Candidates

```text
TABLE candidates {
    id: UUID PK
    full_name: VARCHAR
    email: VARCHAR UNIQUE
    phone: VARCHAR
    position: VARCHAR
    profile: JSONB
    created_at: TIMESTAMP
    updated_at: TIMESTAMP
}
```

#### profile JSONB

```json
{
    "education": [],
    "experience": [],
    "projects": [],
    "skills": [],
    "certificates": [],
    "github": "",
    "linkedin": "",
    "resume_text": ""
}
```

---

### 2.2 Bảng Interviews

```text
TABLE interviews {
    id: UUID PK

    candidate_id: UUID FK candidates.id

    status: VARCHAR

    state: JSONB

    started_at: TIMESTAMP
    completed_at: TIMESTAMP

    created_at: TIMESTAMP
}
```

#### state JSONB

```json
{
    "current_question": 5,
    "interview_stage": "technical",
    "topics_covered": [],
    "remaining_topics": [],
    "current_skill_focus": ""
}
```

---

### 2.3 Bảng Conversation Messages

```text
TABLE conversation_messages {
    id: UUID PK

    interview_id: UUID FK interviews.id

    role: VARCHAR

    content: TEXT

    metadata: JSONB

    created_at: TIMESTAMP
}
```

---

### 2.4 Bảng Candidate Scores

```text
TABLE candidate_scores {
    id: UUID PK

    candidate_id: UUID FK candidates.id

    interview_id: UUID FK interviews.id

    skill_name: VARCHAR

    score: FLOAT

    confidence: FLOAT

    evidence_count: INTEGER

    updated_at: TIMESTAMP
}
```

---

### 2.5 Bảng Skill Evidence

```text
TABLE skill_evidence {
    id: UUID PK

    candidate_id: UUID FK candidates.id

    interview_id: UUID FK interviews.id

    message_id: UUID FK conversation_messages.id

    skill_name: VARCHAR

    evidence_text: TEXT

    score_impact: FLOAT

    created_at: TIMESTAMP
}
```

---

### 2.6 Bảng Interview Reports

```text
TABLE interview_reports {
    id: UUID PK

    candidate_id: UUID FK candidates.id

    interview_id: UUID FK interviews.id

    overall_score: FLOAT

    technical_score: FLOAT

    communication_score: FLOAT

    problem_solving_score: FLOAT

    strengths: JSONB

    weaknesses: JSONB

    summary: TEXT

    created_at: TIMESTAMP
}
```

---

### 2.7 Quan hệ dữ liệu

```text
candidates
    |
    +------ interviews
                |
                +------ conversation_messages
                |
                +------ candidate_scores
                |
                +------ skill_evidence
                |
                +------ interview_reports
```

---

### 2.8 Candidate Lifecycle

```text
Upload CV
    ↓
Create Candidate
    ↓
Interview Session
    ↓
Conversation History
    ↓
Skill Assessment
    ↓
Evidence Tracking
    ↓
Final Report
```

